        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Grinderman; Nick Cave and the Bad Seeds\n- People: Nick Cave; Mick Harvey; Blixa Bargeld\n- Albums: Grinderman\n- Songs: \"No Pussy Blues\"\n- Record Labels: Mute Records; ANTI-\n- Places: Melbourne; Europe; United States\n\nFacts:\n- Nick Cave and the Bad Seeds are an Australian rock band formed in Melbourne in 1983 by Nick Cave, Mick Harvey, and Blixa Bargeld.\n- Grinderman is an alternative rock band and a side project of members of Nick Cave and the Bad Seeds.\n- Grinderman is the eponymous debut studio album by Grinderman.\n- Grinderman was released on March 5, 2007, on Mute Records in Europe and on ANTI- in the United States.\n- \"No Pussy Blues\" is the second single by Grinderman from the band's debut album Grinderman.",
